1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Tenth Episode
The Dangerous Doll

15
00:02:22,461 --> 00:02:24,452
Prince Franz, shame on you!

16
00:02:24,501 --> 00:02:26,890
A noble of your rank
yawning like that..!

17
00:02:26,941 --> 00:02:29,455
I am so sorry! Last
night I read until late.

18
00:02:29,781 --> 00:02:32,659
Watch how you behave
when we are ashore.

19
00:02:32,701 --> 00:02:35,010
You are a Prince and
everyone will be watching you!

20
00:02:43,541 --> 00:02:46,101
Grand Duke Duralumin,
where is the Prince, my son?

21
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:48,450
He went for a walk,
Sire.

22
00:02:49,101 --> 00:02:51,820
Unfortunately, Sapphire
always embarrasses me.

23
00:02:51,861 --> 00:02:54,056
On the other hand, Franz is a fine Prince!

24
00:03:11,581 --> 00:03:15,096
Welcome
to our lands, dear Chanel V!

25
00:03:15,141 --> 00:03:18,053
We are pleased to see you again
after such a long time.

26
00:03:25,621 --> 00:03:28,135
And so Prince Franz
has disappeared?

27
00:03:28,621 --> 00:03:32,534
It seems so! He too had been
invited as a guest to court!

28
00:03:32,581 --> 00:03:36,130
One does not disregard etiquette like this!
His father is very displeased about it!

29
00:03:36,181 --> 00:03:38,934
I like him
and I'm going to look for him too!

30
00:03:39,261 --> 00:03:42,651
You cannot! First you must greet
Chanel V! Wait!

31
00:03:42,781 --> 00:03:45,170
Don't worry so much
about etiquette!

32
00:03:45,221 --> 00:03:47,291
Tell them I've disappeared too!

33
00:03:47,741 --> 00:03:51,017
Stop! You cannot do that!
Ah, the youth of today!

34
00:03:54,541 --> 00:03:57,009
Are you ready, Opal?
Let's go, little horse!

35
00:04:13,621 --> 00:04:16,613
Sapphire, I'm here!
Take me with you, please!

36
00:05:22,901 --> 00:05:25,461
Sapphire must have come
to this town.

37
00:05:27,341 --> 00:05:31,300
Who knows where he went...! I'll ask
someone if they've seen him.

38
00:05:32,861 --> 00:05:34,692
Is anyone there?

39
00:05:34,741 --> 00:05:37,016
How strange, it seems empty.

40
00:05:39,181 --> 00:05:41,251
What did I bump into?

41
00:05:52,221 --> 00:05:54,940
And what is this?
By the look of it, it seems to be a doll

42
00:05:58,061 --> 00:05:59,733
This way, please.

43
00:06:01,341 --> 00:06:04,174
- Is this the mechanical doll?
- Yes, Grand Duke.

44
00:06:04,221 --> 00:06:08,009
It wasn't easy to make it, but in the
end the result is... remarkable!

45
00:06:08,061 --> 00:06:10,177
Just think, I had to
bring from a far-off country.

46
00:06:10,221 --> 00:06:12,496
...a master puppeteer
to build it for me.

47
00:06:12,541 --> 00:06:14,213
Enough chatter!

48
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:16,855
Can you assure me this doll
will serve to kill Sapphire?

49
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:19,900
Yes, of course, Grand Duke!
This time we will not fail,

50
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:23,092
if Sapphire watches the carnival
from the seat he reserved.

51
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:27,015
Do you know it walks?
In its stomach there is a boiler.

52
00:06:27,060 --> 00:06:29,495
...that boils the water.
The steam that is released...

53
00:06:29,540 --> 00:06:32,692
...drives an engine that allows her
to move and to walk.

54
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:35,938
- Ingenious, isn't it?
- Yes, not bad, not bad

55
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:38,734
I'm wondering if this doll
also talks.

56
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:40,817
- No. - It would be fantastic
if she could.

57
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:43,216
It would be the best invention
of all time.

58
00:06:44,020 --> 00:06:46,535
Damn!
But then she can talk!

59
00:06:46,580 --> 00:06:48,811
But it wasn't her,
because she can't talk!

60
00:06:48,860 --> 00:06:51,216
- That's who it was!
- They saw me!

61
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:54,013
Wait, little one!

62
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:57,654
Thank goodness!
Don't move!

63
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:14,016
Where could he have got to?
He can't have gone far.

64
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:17,132
I can't find him.

65
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:22,457
Yet he must be here

66
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:33,897
Damned kid!
I won't let him escape from here!

67
00:07:33,940 --> 00:07:36,899
- I'll stop you!
- Help! Help, he wants to kill me!

68
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:43,816
Oh, no!

69
00:07:54,260 --> 00:07:56,252
What beautiful fireworks!

70
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:01,739
What a blow!

71
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:04,375
- Prince Sapphire!
- Prince Franz!

72
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:06,616
I see you've escaped from the castle.

73
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:10,132
Listen, here in town they are celebrating
carnival! Shall we go see?

74
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,013
As you wish.

75
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:20,411
Don't you think it's better to stay here?

76
00:08:23,900 --> 00:08:27,610
- Yes, you're absolutely right!
- You should go out every now and then.

77
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:32,540
In the city there are
a lot of fun things!

78
00:08:32,580 --> 00:08:35,015
I don't have much time.
Almost everything I have...

79
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:37,291
...I need to prevent
Nylon and Duralumin...

80
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:39,491
...from carrying out
their evil plans.

81
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,293
Don't think about it!

82
00:08:43,420 --> 00:08:45,889
When we are Kings, we won't
be able to have fun anymore.

83
00:08:45,941 --> 00:08:48,375
Oh, I just thought of something!

84
00:08:48,621 --> 00:08:51,260
Here, it's for you!
Come on, take it!

85
00:08:51,501 --> 00:08:54,732
I bought it before I
left. I think you'll like it.

86
00:08:56,861 --> 00:08:58,419
What is this?

87
00:08:58,461 --> 00:09:00,816
It's a mirror! It's for
looking at yourself.

88
00:09:01,221 --> 00:09:04,133
I heard
that maybe you are a girl.

89
00:09:04,741 --> 00:09:07,016
It will come in handy,
if you really are!

90
00:09:07,061 --> 00:09:09,017
You really are a fool,
Prince Franz!

91
00:09:25,901 --> 00:09:28,335
Who are you, dressed
in such funny clothes?

92
00:09:28,381 --> 00:09:30,417
We are a group of masked
revelers and we are going around...

93
00:09:30,461 --> 00:09:32,850
...celebrating Carnival.
Come with us, too!

94
00:09:32,901 --> 00:09:35,335
Yes, come with us!

95
00:09:35,421 --> 00:09:39,699
No! No, please!
Please! I don't want to!

96
00:09:43,181 --> 00:09:45,411
Magnificent! It's the
most beautiful costume!

97
00:09:45,461 --> 00:09:47,497
- It's number one!
- The best of the costumes!

98
00:09:48,381 --> 00:09:50,690
I feel a bit uncomfortable
dressed up like this.

99
00:09:50,741 --> 00:09:52,891
And now we're off to town.

100
00:10:22,181 --> 00:10:25,253
Who could that beautiful
girl with the long hair be?

101
00:10:25,581 --> 00:10:27,299
She's enchanting!

102
00:10:29,301 --> 00:10:31,531
I must try to meet her.

103
00:10:35,621 --> 00:10:37,691
Excuse me, may I have this dance?

104
00:12:14,021 --> 00:12:16,012
Someone is galloping this way!

105
00:12:17,581 --> 00:12:20,573
They're soldiers!
What do they want?

106
00:12:22,421 --> 00:12:26,175
His Majesty is pleased to invite
you to the ball at the royal castle!

107
00:12:41,421 --> 00:12:45,016
- His Majesty!
- His Majesty is truly generous!

108
00:13:01,181 --> 00:13:04,173
Where could she have
gone? I can't find her!

109
00:13:06,581 --> 00:13:09,539
Excuse me, have you seen
a young girl with long hair?

110
00:13:09,581 --> 00:13:12,539
- No, I haven't seen anyone like that.
- And you, sir?

111
00:13:12,861 --> 00:13:15,011
No, I haven't seen her either.

112
00:13:15,701 --> 00:13:19,011
And yet I am sure that she too
is here, somewhere.

113
00:13:19,061 --> 00:13:21,734
Baron Nylon, what have you done
with that boy you captured?

114
00:13:22,421 --> 00:13:24,616
I locked him in the building
where the doll is,

115
00:13:24,661 --> 00:13:27,221
so tomorrow he too will end up
together with Sapphire!

116
00:13:29,141 --> 00:13:32,019
Those two are plotting
to kill Sapphire!

117
00:13:32,061 --> 00:13:35,451
I must look for him immediately and
warn him of the danger he is in!

118
00:13:35,781 --> 00:13:39,376
Do you have any idea where
our two offspring might be?

119
00:13:39,421 --> 00:13:42,493
There's no need to worry, they must be
having fun somewhere.

120
00:13:42,541 --> 00:13:45,613
- Oops!
- Please, Prince! Have mercy!

121
00:13:45,661 --> 00:13:47,538
Now you will play something
more cheerful!

122
00:13:47,581 --> 00:13:49,776
As you wish, Prince!
At your command!

123
00:13:49,821 --> 00:13:52,415
Look at Sapphire, up to
one of his usual tricks!

124
00:13:52,501 --> 00:13:54,492
As cheeky as ever!

125
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:07,650
Maestro, I told you to play
more cheerful music.

126
00:14:07,701 --> 00:14:09,419
More than this?

127
00:14:13,941 --> 00:14:16,216
We are still not there!
I would like it more elegant

128
00:14:16,261 --> 00:14:18,217
What the hell can we play?

129
00:14:18,901 --> 00:14:21,540
- Sapphire!
- Who is calling me?

130
00:14:22,301 --> 00:14:24,735
I am here, Sapphire!
Can you come? I have to talk to you!

131
00:14:25,741 --> 00:14:28,050
What do you have to tell me that is so important?

132
00:14:28,141 --> 00:14:30,701
I caught Baron Nylon
and Grand Duke Duralumin...

133
00:14:30,741 --> 00:14:32,811
while they were talking about killing you

134
00:14:33,141 --> 00:14:35,371
- It's no surprise!
- What?!

135
00:14:35,421 --> 00:14:38,538
Yes, it is nothing new to me!
It is always the same story.

136
00:14:38,621 --> 00:14:40,737
They were also talking about that child
called Tink...

137
00:14:40,781 --> 00:14:42,772
...and that, if I'm not
mistaken, is a friend of yours.

138
00:14:42,821 --> 00:14:45,654
They said they are keeping him
prisoner in a building outside the city.

139
00:14:45,701 --> 00:14:47,657
Good heavens! What are you saying?

140
00:15:10,701 --> 00:15:13,010
I will start looking for
him from this house!

141
00:15:20,021 --> 00:15:22,330
Tink, are you here? Tink!

142
00:15:23,901 --> 00:15:26,938
I think I can make out the
shapes of strange puppets.

143
00:15:35,221 --> 00:15:37,416
Tink, answer! Are you here?

144
00:15:38,901 --> 00:15:40,539
What a huge doll!

145
00:15:40,901 --> 00:15:43,813
Tink! Tink, can you hear me?

146
00:15:44,341 --> 00:15:47,617
Answer! Are you in here, Tink?

147
00:16:01,901 --> 00:16:04,210
It seems that in here
he is not.

148
00:16:04,821 --> 00:16:06,812
I'll go look for him somewhere else.

149
00:16:25,741 --> 00:16:29,017
Dear Baron, I can't wait for
this doll to go into action.

150
00:16:30,741 --> 00:16:33,130
Me too, Grand Duke!
I will show you something.

151
00:16:33,181 --> 00:16:34,819
Do you see that wire?

152
00:16:35,341 --> 00:16:38,697
As soon as the doll's head
is level with that wire,

153
00:16:39,021 --> 00:16:42,411
its mechanism will fire a shot
right at Sapphire's chest!

154
00:16:42,581 --> 00:16:45,141
But do you think the Prince
will stand still...

155
00:16:45,181 --> 00:16:47,217
...until the doll
has passed?

156
00:16:47,261 --> 00:16:50,094
Don't worry! Together with the
doctor, I've worked out a little trick.

157
00:16:53,621 --> 00:16:56,613
So, Sapphire, tell me: did you
manage to find that friend of yours?

158
00:16:56,661 --> 00:17:00,017
Not yet. I've looked for him all
day, but there is no sign of him.

159
00:17:00,061 --> 00:17:02,416
You've reminded me
that I must go back and look for him!

160
00:17:02,501 --> 00:17:05,459
Stay seated, Your Highness!
You promised me...

161
00:17:05,501 --> 00:17:08,493
...that you would be a good
Prince for the whole day.

162
00:17:08,541 --> 00:17:11,817
You're right, I promised you.
I'll stay in my seat.

163
00:17:27,621 --> 00:17:30,181
Where am I?
Judging by the construction,

164
00:17:30,221 --> 00:17:32,416
I must be
inside the doll!

165
00:17:35,021 --> 00:17:37,251
I'm pretty sure it's moving!

166
00:17:38,741 --> 00:17:40,857
In the doll's mouth
I have placed a bow...

167
00:17:40,901 --> 00:17:43,210
...ready to shoot his arrow that
will strike Sapphire in the heart!

168
00:17:43,261 --> 00:17:45,491
A single shot will be enough, Grand Duke!

169
00:17:46,301 --> 00:17:48,292
Maybe I understand.

170
00:18:06,541 --> 00:18:08,736
Sapphire, you are in danger! Sapphire!

171
00:18:08,781 --> 00:18:10,817
Damn it, he can't hear me!

172
00:18:50,341 --> 00:18:52,696
Sapphire, be careful! Sapphire!

173
00:19:18,901 --> 00:19:20,653
The time has come! Here we go!

174
00:19:22,901 --> 00:19:24,619
She has stopped!

175
00:19:27,101 --> 00:19:29,092
Sapphire has been hit!

176
00:19:29,141 --> 00:19:31,814
- It worked!
- It killed my son!

177
00:19:33,661 --> 00:19:35,458
Sapphire, the arrow hit you!

178
00:19:35,501 --> 00:19:38,573
It didn't do anything to me, as
you can see! Your mirror saved me!

179
00:19:38,621 --> 00:19:40,930
Guards!
Destroy that damn puppet!

180
00:19:40,981 --> 00:19:44,815
- Yes, King!
- Help me! Pull me up!

181
00:19:48,021 --> 00:19:50,012
I'll show you!

182
00:19:59,821 --> 00:20:02,016
Damned giant puppet!

183
00:20:11,621 --> 00:20:13,612
Come on!

184
00:20:30,901 --> 00:20:32,937
Hey, stop! What do you want to do?!

185
00:20:35,181 --> 00:20:36,819
There he is!

186
00:20:55,021 --> 00:20:56,818
Opal!

187
00:21:01,941 --> 00:21:04,216
I must stop
that crazy doll!

188
00:21:18,221 --> 00:21:19,893
There it is!

189
00:21:25,741 --> 00:21:27,413
Now I'm inside!

190
00:21:27,661 --> 00:21:30,414
- Thank heaven, you're alive!
- Tink! What are you doing in here?

191
00:21:30,461 --> 00:21:32,531
I was captured
by Baron Nylon!

192
00:21:32,581 --> 00:21:35,015
- Then the doll is his!
- Yes, he wanted to kill you!

193
00:21:35,061 --> 00:21:37,336
We must destroy it!
Just break the boiler!

194
00:21:37,381 --> 00:21:39,019
Do you mean this one?

195
00:21:43,501 --> 00:21:45,378
Watch out, it might explode!

196
00:21:49,581 --> 00:21:52,573
Quick, Sapphire! It's heading
towards the castle!

197
00:22:08,861 --> 00:22:10,897
I will help you stop it!

198
00:22:14,901 --> 00:22:17,131
Raise the drawbridge!

199
00:22:24,061 --> 00:22:25,892
What's happening now?

200
00:22:37,741 --> 00:22:40,096
It is trying
to destroy the castle!

201
00:22:46,501 --> 00:22:49,015
It's dangerous to stay here!
Let's go outside!

202
00:22:49,261 --> 00:22:51,411
- Tink!
- Here I am!

203
00:22:51,901 --> 00:22:54,574
Run as fast as you can!

204
00:23:09,901 --> 00:23:13,576
You know, Franz, without your gift
I would have died! You saved me!

205
00:23:13,901 --> 00:23:17,450
And I apologize to you: I won't
treat you like a girl anymore.

206
00:23:18,181 --> 00:23:20,854
- Thank you!
- During the carnival

207
00:23:20,901 --> 00:23:23,256
I met a girl
who had long hair...

208
00:23:23,301 --> 00:23:26,498
...and she was so pretty!
I hope to see her again, one day.

209
00:23:26,541 --> 00:23:28,452
She has remained in my heart!

210
00:23:41,821 --> 00:23:43,812
Goodbye, Sapphire!

211
00:23:43,861 --> 00:23:46,091
If you happen to meet
that girl,

212
00:23:46,141 --> 00:23:48,257
tell her that I will return for her!

213
00:23:48,501 --> 00:23:52,016
See you soon,
dear Sapphire!

214
00:23:56,821 --> 00:24:01,497
Goodbye, Franz! I really think
that I will meet that girl.

215
00:24:27,301 --> 00:24:30,921
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

216
00:24:30,922 --> 00:24:34,282
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

217
00:24:34,283 --> 00:24:38,053
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

218
00:24:38,054 --> 00:24:41,215
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

219
00:24:41,216 --> 00:24:45,029
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

220
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:48,326
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

221
00:24:48,327 --> 00:24:52,332
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

222
00:24:52,333 --> 00:24:55,771
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

223
00:24:55,772 --> 00:24:59,392
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

224
00:24:59,393 --> 00:25:02,753
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

225
00:25:02,754 --> 00:25:06,524
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

226
00:25:06,525 --> 00:25:09,686
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

227
00:25:09,710 --> 00:25:21,257
